{"time": "2026-06-08T22:36:00", "event": "post_written", "user_id": "a_language_drift_g001_a01_10120193_004", "post_id": "gmw7ll4", "subreddit": "worldnews", "content": "I’m getting tired of world news stories that read like they were polished by a committee trying not to offend anybody. If civilians are dead, say that. If the numbers are uncertain, say that too. But don’t bury the basic facts under five paragraphs of careful phrasing and pretend that makes it clearer. Normal people are just trying to figure out what actually happened."}
